      "body_excerpt": "When it comes to movies I've never seen whose titles I think about on something approaching a daily basis, for me, it doesn't get any better than DUNSTON CHECKS IN.",
      "players": [],
      "teams": [],
      "media": {
        "type": "image",
        "images": [
          {
            "url": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:4xpj3xjxsxxcuh3ghaulzdqu/bafkreiabrztxeek5qzuxamr3r5stqzxgamh4co644zuea5l2kgciexu4ye",
            "alt": "This is the poster to the film DUNSTON CHECKS IN. It features a orangutan with boxer shorts on surfing on a briefcase with his hands behind his head, looking extremely chill, in front of (but, because of forced perspective, roughly the same size as) the gleaming high-rise Majestic Hotel. The tagline, \"He's about to turn a five-star hotel into a three-ring circus,\" is perfect. I have never seen this movie. I think about it all the time."
